       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ATLAUTH.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUTHREQ.
       COPY AUTHRESP.
       COPY LIMITCTX.

       01 WS-ACCOUNT-VALID       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01 WS-MERCHANT-VALID      PIC X VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           INITIALIZE AUTH-RESPONSE LIMIT-CONTEXT
           CALL 'ACCTVAL' USING AUTH-REQUEST WS-ACCOUNT-VALID
           IF WS-ACCOUNT-VALID NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO AS-DECISION
              MOVE 'ACCT' TO AS-REASON-CODE
              PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT
              GOBACK
           END-IF

           CALL 'MERCHCHK' USING AUTH-REQUEST WS-MERCHANT-VALID
           IF WS-MERCHANT-VALID NOT = 'Y'
              MOVE 'D' TO AS-DECISION
              MOVE 'MCC ' TO AS-REASON-CODE
              PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT
              GOBACK
           END-IF

           CALL 'TRNLIM01' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           MOVE LC-FINAL-LIMIT TO AS-APPLIED-LIMIT

           IF AR-AMOUNT <= LC-FINAL-LIMIT
              MOVE 'A' TO AS-DECISION
              MOVE '0000' TO AS-REASON-CODE
           ELSE
              MOVE 'D' TO AS-DECISION
              MOVE 'LIMT' TO AS-REASON-CODE
           END-IF

           PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT
           GOBACK.

       WRITE-AUDIT.
           CALL 'AUTHLOG' USING AUTH-REQUEST AUTH-RESPONSE.
